    STRUCT('embed_pending' AS sq_name, 'v2' AS expected_version, 'v2 -- body moved into ops.sp_sq_embed_pending wrapper (bigquery/75_scheduled_query_wrappers.sql), ARCH-1 2026-07-16' AS git_note, 24 AS expected_interval_hours),
    STRUCT('daily_freshness_check', 'v4', 'v2 -- body moved into ops.sp_sq_daily_freshness_check wrapper (bigquery/75_scheduled_query_wrappers.sql), ARCH-1 2026-07-16. v3, 2026-07-17 (MON STALENESS PART-3) -- RAISE predicate narrowed from all_green to the data-staleness component conjunction only (drops the open-critical-alerts echo term). v4, 2026-08-15 (bigquery/173_freshness_cadence_aware.sql, triage of alert 903e505e) -- the two freshness components move from marks_fresh/engine_fresh to the new cadence-aware marks_current/engine_current on state.system_health. The old basis demanded that marks cover the last MARKET trading day, but the 2026-08-08 Sun-Thu consolidation stopped the daily tier (D2a, the only writer of events.daily_marks and perf.strategy_daily) from running Friday or Saturday -- it backfills Friday on its Sunday run -- so the predicate was structurally unsatisfiable from Friday 22:40 UTC until Sunday evening and this dead-man fired, and FAILED this DTS job into its email-on-failure, twice every weekend with nothing wrong. 2026-08-14 was the first Friday under the new cadence. The replacement compares against state.freshness.marks_due_through, the last trading day at or before the most recent ELAPSED D2a cron slot (40 22 * * 0,1,2,3,4) -- schedule-derived on purpose, NOT keyed on D2a having actually run, since this IS the dead-man for D2a and a run-derived guard goes vacuous exactly when D2a dies. Teeth verified intact: a Sunday D2a that fails to backfill Friday still fires this check at Monday 05:00 UTC. embeddings_healthy and position_drift_detected are unchanged, and the alert category, severity, message and payload are all unchanged. marks_fresh/engine_fresh themselves are untouched and the bigquery/107 trading gates still read them, so the order-staging gate is not loosened. APPLIED LIVE together with this registry row in the same pass 2026-08-15, to avoid the partial-apply trap this note documents throughout.', 24),
